-- Issues: #3
UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under AU-C 705, when the auditor cannot obtain sufficient appropriate evidence due to a scope limitation such as destroyed records, the auditor evaluates the effect on the opinion. If the possible effects are material and pervasive, a disclaimer of opinion is appropriate.
